king pictures. Collect fuel found on the mountains in these depths. Be carful though, you are not the only intelligent creature down here.","steam_appid":3823670,"support_info":{"email":"ambitiousgamedev@gmail","url":""},"supported_languages":"English","type":"game","website":null}